      "id": "sol.amc-8-1989-p8.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\(2 \\times 3 \\times 4 = 24,\\) distribute it over the sum: \\(24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} + 24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} + 24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}.\\)\n\nThis equals \\(12 + 8 + 6 = 26.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
