        "\\(2 \\times 3 \\times 4 = 24;\\) distribute it across the three fractions",
        "\\(24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} + 24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{3} + 24 \\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\)"
